lemma low_tent : let Λ:= A.B.a.clock.loopCap m; (D').down.Bounds (D').low δ (p).paths Λ ∧ 0≤Λ ∧ Λ≤ConnectedActivityE6.loopBill G L y∧ (V).threshold≤2*Pressure.fiery G y L∧ WilsonStartup.Decent (D').low V:= ⟨A.B.support.cap N m hm.le,(coverBill ..).1,(coverBill ..).2.trans (brace _ (gleam R Q A F h|>.veracity)),(K.laws.data.funds.length_eq ▸ K.laws.data.room.temperatures), Shop.decent A F hm⟩
